1
00:01:09,160 --> 00:01:14,770
[Connecting to You]

2
00:01:44,830 --> 00:01:46,710
Are you feeling better?

3
00:01:54,690 --> 00:01:56,050
Much better.

4
00:01:58,470 --> 00:02:00,600
You know, there's a legend

5
00:02:00,630 --> 00:02:04,030
that if two people look into
each other's eyes for eight seconds,

6
00:02:04,030 --> 00:02:06,430
they'll change the way
they see each other.

7
00:02:08,350 --> 00:02:09,940
How will it change?

8
00:02:12,030 --> 00:02:13,730
Right now, you look like

9
00:02:15,670 --> 00:02:17,680
a monkey that just got out of

10
00:02:18,010 --> 00:02:19,010
a hot spring.

11
00:02:19,290 --> 00:02:21,840
What? That's a personal attack!

12
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:22,620
Is it funny?

13
00:02:22,620 --> 00:02:23,210
Is it funny?

14
00:02:23,210 --> 00:02:23,770
Is it funny?

15
00:02:23,770 --> 00:02:24,700
Is it funny?

16
00:02:26,440 --> 00:02:27,880
I thought you weren't feeling well.

17
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:29,610
Why are you still so energetic?

18
00:02:33,060 --> 00:02:34,100
Let me hold it for you.

19
00:02:34,100 --> 00:02:35,310
Put your hand down.

20
00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:40,570
Is it still swollen?

21
00:03:03,830 --> 00:03:05,980
[The Fifth Thread]

22
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:15,910
[The Mere Exposure Effect:
Familiarity Can Really Breed Affection]

23
00:03:15,940 --> 00:03:18,990
[Police]

24
00:03:17,930 --> 00:03:19,260
Household Registration Office?

25
00:03:19,260 --> 00:03:20,120
You and me?

26
00:03:20,710 --> 00:03:22,120
My cousin is getting a divorce,

27
00:03:22,120 --> 00:03:24,120
and she needs two witnesses to sign.

28
00:03:24,790 --> 00:03:27,470
But I don't know your cousin.
Isn't that a bit weird?

29
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:29,110
She doesn't want our relatives to know.

30
00:03:29,110 --> 00:03:30,550
She only told me

31
00:03:30,579 --> 00:03:33,410
and asked me to find another person.
Please!

32
00:03:33,430 --> 00:03:36,290
-Just consider it a good deed.
-Fine, I'll help you.

33
00:03:37,300 --> 00:03:39,140
Lin Jiakai.

34
00:03:39,490 --> 00:03:40,630
Weren't you supposed to
deliver the document?

35
00:03:40,630 --> 00:03:42,260
Why is it still here?

36
00:03:42,820 --> 00:03:43,520
Sorry.

37
00:03:43,540 --> 00:03:45,070
I'll deliver it right away.

38
00:03:47,079 --> 00:03:48,870
Hey, wait a minute!

39
00:03:49,110 --> 00:03:52,370
Is your shirt the same as Dawei's?

40
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:57,579
Dawei, the pocket design
and this thread...

41
00:03:57,610 --> 00:03:59,630
Senior, he saw how good I looked in it,

42
00:03:59,630 --> 00:04:02,130
so he bought the same one.

43
00:04:03,100 --> 00:04:05,250
Yes, it looked good,

44
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:06,310
so I...

45
00:04:07,340 --> 00:04:08,730
copied his style.

46
00:04:09,930 --> 00:04:11,290
It looks exactly the same.

47
00:04:11,290 --> 00:04:15,430
-But this stain... Dawei, didn't you...
-Senior, the car accident mediation...

48
00:04:15,430 --> 00:04:16,930
Oh, right, I forgot.

49
00:04:19,329 --> 00:04:21,589
Remember to deliver it for me. Thank you.

50
00:04:27,620 --> 00:04:31,440
It's okay if you wear it at home,
but why wear it to work?

51
00:04:31,770 --> 00:04:33,720
I forgot to do the laundry,

52
00:04:33,740 --> 00:04:35,140
so I just grabbed one.

53
00:04:35,540 --> 00:04:39,280
How could I know Zhiling would notice
such a weird detail?

54
00:04:39,300 --> 00:04:42,510
Don't ever wear my clothes to work again,

55
00:04:42,540 --> 00:04:43,770
understand?

56
00:04:43,800 --> 00:04:46,170
Okay, I won't do it again.

57
00:04:46,590 --> 00:04:47,960
Then go.

58
00:04:52,220 --> 00:04:53,340
So?

59
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,310
How do we decide?

60
00:04:54,900 --> 00:04:56,270
Rock-paper-scissors.

61
00:04:56,290 --> 00:04:58,730
The loser washes the dishes for a week.
It's a deal.

62
00:04:58,730 --> 00:04:59,670
No backing out.

63
00:04:59,700 --> 00:05:01,920
You're the one
who's more likely to back out.

64
00:05:01,920 --> 00:05:03,690
Should we add doing the laundry?

65
00:05:03,690 --> 00:05:04,720
Okay.

66
00:05:06,010 --> 00:05:07,490
Yes!

67
00:05:13,050 --> 00:05:14,520
Jiakai, help me.

68
00:05:15,610 --> 00:05:16,940
What are you doing here?

69
00:05:23,100 --> 00:05:24,830
What happened to your threads?

70
00:05:26,530 --> 00:05:28,000
I'm getting married.

71
00:05:32,260 --> 00:05:33,920
Are you going to tell us or not?

72
00:05:34,350 --> 00:05:36,760
Or are you here just for the free drinks?

73
00:05:40,930 --> 00:05:43,100
I'm really anxious!

74
00:05:43,159 --> 00:05:45,290
Can't I at least have some free drinks?

75
00:05:45,730 --> 00:05:46,880
Of course you can,

76
00:05:46,909 --> 00:05:49,659
but please tell us what happened.

77
00:05:52,790 --> 00:05:56,790
At the end of the semester,
Yujing held a mixer,

78
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,780
and she invited me.

79
00:05:59,750 --> 00:06:00,990
At the mixer,

80
00:06:03,120 --> 00:06:05,060
I met a senior.

81
00:06:06,030 --> 00:06:09,030
She's beautiful and elegant,

82
00:06:14,630 --> 00:06:16,460
and she's got a very cute name,

83
00:06:17,910 --> 00:06:22,790
Liang Chuqing.

84
00:06:25,420 --> 00:06:27,050
She was given that name

85
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:29,110
because it rained for an entire month

86
00:06:29,110 --> 00:06:32,430
before she was born,

87
00:06:32,860 --> 00:06:34,780
but on the day she was born,

88
00:06:35,220 --> 00:06:36,680
the sky cleared up.

89
00:06:38,090 --> 00:06:39,220
So,

90
00:06:39,900 --> 00:06:41,150
her father

91
00:06:41,750 --> 00:06:43,460
named her

92
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:47,240
Chuqing (clear sky after the rain).

93
00:06:57,470 --> 00:06:58,970
Here's what happened.

94
00:06:58,990 --> 00:07:01,760
We dated for three weeks,

95
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,400
and one night,

96
00:07:05,740 --> 00:07:07,390
as I watched her walk away,

97
00:07:09,460 --> 00:07:10,770
I suddenly felt

98
00:07:14,420 --> 00:07:15,880
that I couldn't leave her.

99
00:07:17,540 --> 00:07:18,910
So, I proposed to her.

100
00:07:18,940 --> 00:07:21,540
And that's when everything
started to change.

101
00:07:28,300 --> 00:07:29,360
Chaonan.

102
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:32,659
Eat the cake.

103
00:07:33,380 --> 00:07:34,770
What are you doing?

104
00:07:35,420 --> 00:07:36,520
Aren't you going to eat?

105
00:07:36,520 --> 00:07:37,600
No, thanks.

106
00:07:37,970 --> 00:07:39,100
Have a bite.

107
00:07:39,430 --> 00:07:40,950
Come on, try it.

108
00:07:40,980 --> 00:07:44,600
-Let me feed you.
-No, no, no!

109
00:07:44,620 --> 00:07:45,940
Don't eat me! No!

110
00:07:45,970 --> 00:07:47,000
No, no!

111
00:07:47,030 --> 00:07:48,790
-Don't eat me!
-Chaonan!

112
00:07:48,820 --> 00:07:51,030
-Chaonan!
-Chaonan! Chaonan!

113
00:07:51,050 --> 00:07:52,450
Are you okay?

114
00:07:53,340 --> 00:07:55,090
I'm fine.

115
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:57,090
You only dated her for three weeks,

116
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:58,780
-and you proposed.
-I'm fine.

117
00:07:58,850 --> 00:08:00,450
You must've freaked her out.

118
00:08:03,020 --> 00:08:04,020
But she said yes.

119
00:08:04,250 --> 00:08:05,430
She said yes?

120
00:08:08,420 --> 00:08:09,290
Well,

121
00:08:09,890 --> 00:08:12,170
we should congratulate you, shouldn't we?

122
00:08:12,170 --> 00:08:13,330
What's the problem?

123
00:08:13,790 --> 00:08:15,190
It's a big problem.

124
00:08:15,720 --> 00:08:17,800
Ever since she accepted my proposal,

125
00:08:19,360 --> 00:08:21,290
she's turned into a control freak.

126
00:08:22,500 --> 00:08:23,220
Look.

127
00:08:25,290 --> 00:08:28,580
Wedding photos, pre-marital health check,

128
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:29,800
job interview...

129
00:08:29,830 --> 00:08:31,440
Job interview?

130
00:08:31,790 --> 00:08:34,110
What does that have to do
with your marriage?

131
00:08:34,110 --> 00:08:36,039
Her dad works in a foreign company,

132
00:08:36,179 --> 00:08:38,120
and he told us to work there
after we get married.

133
00:08:38,120 --> 00:08:39,320
The salary is good.

134
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,030
She said the salary

135
00:08:41,510 --> 00:08:42,760
is enough for us

136
00:08:42,780 --> 00:08:44,700
to raise ten kids!

137
00:08:46,020 --> 00:08:47,850
Am I a breeding machine to her?

138
00:08:48,650 --> 00:08:51,550
Ten kids are just too many
even for a breeding machine!

139
00:08:51,550 --> 00:08:53,720
Since you can't reach a consensus,

140
00:08:53,890 --> 00:08:55,810
why not just break up?

141
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:58,240
Her dad is a retired Sea Dragon Frogman.

142
00:08:58,530 --> 00:09:00,400
She said if I back out,

143
00:09:00,420 --> 00:09:02,350
her dad will break my legs!

144
00:09:04,080 --> 00:09:06,480
-It's not just a dead knot.
-How could this happen?

145
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:08,480
You're completely tied down by her.

146
00:09:09,290 --> 00:09:10,080
Please!

147
00:09:10,220 --> 00:09:12,010
Please let me stay.

148
00:09:12,030 --> 00:09:13,480
I need to hide from her for a while.

149
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,230
Oh, no.

150
00:09:14,320 --> 00:09:16,990
I need to hide for a lifetime! Please!

151
00:09:19,660 --> 00:09:21,740
He said he was too anxious to sleep,

152
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:22,850
and look at him now.

153
00:09:28,830 --> 00:09:30,290
Looks awesome, right?

154
00:09:30,310 --> 00:09:31,130
Not bad.

155
00:09:33,950 --> 00:09:35,880
Why are you still wearing my shirt?

156
00:09:36,260 --> 00:09:37,980
Just let me wear it for today.

157
00:09:38,980 --> 00:09:40,180
I'll wash it for you.

158
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:41,360
No.

159
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:42,940
Change it later.

160
00:09:43,570 --> 00:09:44,990
Why are you so cruel?

161
00:09:48,100 --> 00:09:49,580
If you don't let me wear it,

162
00:09:49,970 --> 00:09:51,850
you can't eat the noodles I cooked.

163
00:09:51,850 --> 00:09:54,280
I'm going to eat them,
and you'll return it.

164
00:09:54,310 --> 00:09:55,130
No!

165
00:09:56,520 --> 00:09:57,480
Will you let me wear it or not?

166
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,240
No!

167
00:09:58,890 --> 00:10:00,020
Give it back!

168
00:10:00,050 --> 00:10:01,360
Give it back! I want to eat noodles!

169
00:10:01,360 --> 00:10:02,080
I want to eat noodles!

170
00:10:01,740 --> 00:10:06,210
[Moon Street Coffee]

171
00:10:04,300 --> 00:10:06,160
Wait a moment there for your meal.

172
00:10:06,970 --> 00:10:08,700
What would you like to order?

173
00:10:12,160 --> 00:10:13,160
Is it you?

174
00:10:14,510 --> 00:10:15,760
Who are you?

175
00:10:15,780 --> 00:10:17,910
Are you the one
who was against me marrying Chaonan?

176
00:10:17,910 --> 00:10:18,910
Who is she?

177
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,930
Why is she wearing a wedding dress?

178
00:10:23,140 --> 00:10:25,710
Why did you say Chaonan would face
a fatal disaster if he marries me?

179
00:10:25,710 --> 00:10:29,260
I never said that.

180
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:33,720
I said "a dead knot."

181
00:10:33,740 --> 00:10:35,840
It means his threads
will be tied into a dead knot

182
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:38,660
after marriage.

183
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:42,060
It doesn't mean
he'll face a fatal disaster

184
00:10:42,090 --> 00:10:43,420
and die.

185
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:44,970
Chaonan probably
didn't explain it clearly.

186
00:10:44,970 --> 00:10:45,810
He'll be fine.

187
00:10:45,830 --> 00:10:47,870
If you want to get married, just do it.

188
00:10:47,870 --> 00:10:48,870
Don't worry.

189
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:53,950
Then...

190
00:10:55,320 --> 00:10:57,220
Do you know where he is now?

191
00:10:57,790 --> 00:11:00,390
We were supposed to
take wedding photos today,

192
00:11:00,400 --> 00:11:01,850
but he didn't show up,

193
00:11:01,870 --> 00:11:03,350
and I can't contact him.

194
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,590
I'm a bit worried.

195
00:11:08,450 --> 00:11:09,980
I'll call him.

196
00:11:10,190 --> 00:11:11,900
Perhaps he overslept.

197
00:11:11,920 --> 00:11:12,650
Okay.

198
00:11:26,970 --> 00:11:27,910
[Chaonan] [If anyone asks where I am,]

199
00:11:27,910 --> 00:11:29,060
[Chaonan] [don't tell them,]

200
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:30,790
[Chaonan] [or I'll kill you!]

201
00:11:35,250 --> 00:11:36,950
He didn't answer my call.

202
00:11:38,180 --> 00:11:39,900
Just wait a bit longer.

203
00:11:39,930 --> 00:11:43,050
Scold him when he shows up.

204
00:11:47,140 --> 00:11:48,370
I won't scold him.

205
00:11:48,710 --> 00:11:50,260
I just want to know

206
00:11:50,280 --> 00:11:52,420
if he's safe.

207
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:56,640
Do you really want to marry

208
00:11:56,800 --> 00:11:58,380
that childish Chaonan?

209
00:12:02,900 --> 00:12:04,790
Can I ask why?

210
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:08,880
If I tell you,

211
00:12:09,240 --> 00:12:10,760
will you help me find him?

212
00:12:12,050 --> 00:12:12,930
Of course.

213
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:18,240
Honestly, Chaonan

214
00:12:18,260 --> 00:12:22,560
is really sincere, and he treats me well.

215
00:12:23,090 --> 00:12:25,350
One time we went for Italian food,

216
00:12:25,580 --> 00:12:28,930
and I ordered squid ink pasta
just to see his reaction.

217
00:12:29,280 --> 00:12:30,680
My mouth was full of ink,

218
00:12:30,710 --> 00:12:33,040
but he still looked at me affectionately.

219
00:12:33,610 --> 00:12:35,220
When he saw it got on my clothes,

220
00:12:35,220 --> 00:12:36,880
he wiped it for me carefully.

221
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:38,660
At that moment,

222
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:40,420
I felt he was

223
00:12:41,660 --> 00:12:42,760
really kind

224
00:12:43,520 --> 00:12:44,740
and gentle.

225
00:12:45,430 --> 00:12:46,430
So,

226
00:12:46,530 --> 00:12:48,710
when he proposed to me,

227
00:12:48,830 --> 00:12:49,940
I was moved.

228
00:12:51,870 --> 00:12:54,240
So, I accidentally helped him?

229
00:12:56,890 --> 00:12:57,700
Alright.

230
00:12:58,470 --> 00:13:01,720
I think I need to cancel today's shoot.

231
00:13:02,230 --> 00:13:03,350
If

232
00:13:03,420 --> 00:13:05,080
you see him,

233
00:13:06,080 --> 00:13:07,740
please tell him to contact me.

234
00:13:21,580 --> 00:13:22,470
Chaonan.

235
00:13:23,810 --> 00:13:25,140
How do you know I'm here?

236
00:13:25,670 --> 00:13:27,820
Did you forget
you have a bunch of threads on your head?

237
00:13:27,820 --> 00:13:32,150
[Psychic Club]

238
00:13:28,370 --> 00:13:29,700
Oh, pretty impressive.

239
00:13:31,280 --> 00:13:32,280
Are you coming in?

240
00:13:32,390 --> 00:13:36,780
[Open]

241
00:13:35,360 --> 00:13:36,860
Why are you here?

242
00:13:36,910 --> 00:13:38,790
How could you bail on her like that?

243
00:13:38,790 --> 00:13:40,040
Lin Jiakai!

244
00:13:40,150 --> 00:13:41,060
Take this.

245
00:13:41,530 --> 00:13:42,250
Thanks.

246
00:13:43,180 --> 00:13:45,930
[Open]

247
00:13:46,060 --> 00:13:50,800
[Psychic Club]

248
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:49,990
Hurry up and change your clothes.

249
00:13:50,660 --> 00:13:52,120
Come on!

250
00:13:52,600 --> 00:13:55,670
You have no idea how much time I spent
picking this out for you.

251
00:13:55,670 --> 00:13:59,130
And did you reply to me
about the time we have dinner with my dad?

252
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:00,190
I did.

253
00:14:01,230 --> 00:14:02,420
Good.

254
00:14:13,270 --> 00:14:15,880
Is this Chuqing,

255
00:14:14,770 --> 00:14:18,430
[Liang Chuqing]

256
00:14:16,320 --> 00:14:17,450
Chaonan's fiancée?

257
00:14:19,120 --> 00:14:20,920
Why are you checking her photos?

258
00:14:21,810 --> 00:14:24,930
I'm just a bit worried.

259
00:14:25,780 --> 00:14:26,960
A bit concerned.

260
00:14:31,070 --> 00:14:32,200
Worried about what?

261
00:14:33,180 --> 00:14:35,460
Worried about your friend's life
after getting married?

262
00:14:35,460 --> 00:14:38,120
He made a hasty proposal
without thinking it through,

263
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:39,980
so he must face the consequences.

264
00:14:40,940 --> 00:14:43,580
And it's not wrong for her to make plans

265
00:14:43,600 --> 00:14:44,780
for their marriage.

266
00:14:46,790 --> 00:14:48,160
Why do you always
make other people's problems

267
00:14:48,160 --> 00:14:49,290
your own?

268
00:14:49,690 --> 00:14:50,640
Are you that desperate to prove

269
00:14:50,640 --> 00:14:52,640
that your third eye can help others?

270
00:14:53,060 --> 00:14:54,320
What if you don't help?

271
00:15:03,970 --> 00:15:05,050
Lin Jiakai!

272
00:15:05,080 --> 00:15:06,970
What beautiful girl are you looking at?
You're so into it.

273
00:15:06,970 --> 00:15:08,350
You freaked me out!

274
00:15:08,380 --> 00:15:10,000
What?

275
00:15:10,620 --> 00:15:12,450
This is ridiculous!

276
00:15:12,740 --> 00:15:14,040
Why would a beauty like Chuqing

277
00:15:14,040 --> 00:15:16,950
marry an idiot who can't even graduate?

278
00:15:17,390 --> 00:15:19,500
I really shouldn't have invited Chaonan
to the mixer!

279
00:15:19,500 --> 00:15:21,330
He'll ruin her life!

280
00:15:23,520 --> 00:15:25,820
Are you close with Chuqing?

281
00:15:25,840 --> 00:15:27,550
