430
00:21:57,330 --> 00:21:58,620
And for the easiest things to do,

431
00:21:58,620 --> 00:21:59,380
I would say,

432
00:21:59,400 --> 00:22:00,430
"Look,

433
00:22:00,040 --> 00:22:00,270
[Cool]

434
00:22:00,460 --> 00:22:02,450
just show up around him
every now and then."

435
00:22:02,450 --> 00:22:04,450
For example, when handing in exam papers,

436
00:22:02,870 --> 00:22:04,150
[Exam Paper]

437
00:22:04,450 --> 00:22:06,160
