446
00:22:19,000 --> 00:22:19,870
I miss him so much.

447
00:22:19,870 --> 00:22:21,790
Should I ask him to get back together?

448
00:22:21,790 --> 00:22:23,590
If I often appear in front of him,

449
00:22:23,590 --> 00:22:24,250
