455
00:22:34,250 --> 00:22:36,410
Once you've found some strength

456
00:22:36,410 --> 00:22:38,160
while learning to love yourself,

457
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:39,910
look back and ask yourself

458
00:22:39,910 --> 00:22:42,450
if this guy is really worth

459
00:22:42,450 --> 00:22:43,950
all the longing and hard feelings,

460
00:22:43,950 --> 00:22:45,410
okay?

461
00:22:45,410 --> 00:22:46,410
Now, everyone,

462
00:22:46,410 --> 00:22:47,750
